{
  "obj_dw_fcastle_fusumadodge_slash_Step_0_gml_25_0": "この　お話…\n気に入ってもらえる\nだろうか…",
  "obj_dw_fcastle_fusumadodge_slash_Step_0_gml_204_0": "およおよ！\nこれ\nよけられる？",
  "obj_dw_fcastle_fusumadodge_slash_Step_0_gml_448_0": "スピン",
  "obj_dw_fcastle_fusumadodge_slash_Step_0_gml_449_0": "オレが回してやる…",
  "obj_dw_fcastle_fusumadodge_slash_Step_0_gml_484_0": "およ！　アズゴアは\nクルクル回るナイフが\n好きなの？　おっけー！",
  "obj_dw_fcastle_fusumadodge_slash_Step_0_gml_540_0": "およ！　アズゴアは\nターコのナイフ\n気に入ってくれる\nかな！？",
  "obj_dw_fcastle_fusumadodge_slash_Step_0_gml_570_0": "モリス！\nアズゴアは　きっと\nクルクル回る本が\n好きだよ！",
  "obj_dw_fcastle_fusumadodge_slash_Step_0_gml_588_0": "ひとまず…\nふつうの本を\n試そう…",
  "obj_dw_fcastle_fusumadodge_slash_Step_0_gml_640_0": "…！\nヤツらが来たぞ！\n足止めしろ！！",
  "obj_dw_fcastle_fusumadodge_slash_Step_0_gml_664_0": "ふすまを\n使わなかった…\nだと…？",
  "obj_dw_fcastle_fusumadodge_slash_Step_0_gml_670_0": "があぁ！\nふすまを\n使われたぁ！！",
  "obj_dw_fcastle_fusumadodge_slash_Step_0_gml_676_0": "ヘッ…\nどうだッ！"
}